record2context includes code adapted from TraceBug (https://github.com/prashantsinghmangat/TraceBug-ai),
develop branch, v1.11.1. Adapted files carry a one-line origin comment at the top.

Adapted from TraceBug:
- src/content/labels.ts       (buildSelector, fieldLabel in src/collectors.ts)
- src/content/inputs.ts       (collectInputs, isSensitiveField, contentEditableHost in src/collectors.ts)
- src/content/index.ts        (click/key capture in src/collectors.ts)
- src/content/editor.ts       (drawing ideas from src/draw-mode.ts, src/region-screenshot.ts)
- src/main/index.ts           (fetch/XHR wrappers, route and error collectors in src/collectors.ts)
- src/shared/network-dedupe.ts (src/network-dedupe.ts)
- src/shared/redact.ts        (sanitizeUrl in src/collectors.ts, isSensitiveParamName in src/url-hygiene.ts)

The review UI (review/ui/) follows the layout of TraceBug's exported-report viewer (src/exporters/html-template.ts:
video with an event timeline and synced Console / Network / Actions tabs). No code was copied from it.

